{"id":"2df724f4df6208b90b765105437472fa064a30ce","axis":"silent","repo":"microsoft/vscode","sha":"2df724f4df6208b90b765105437472fa064a30ce","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"src/vs/platform/agentHost/AGENTS.md","lines":["@@ -42,6 +42,8 @@"," "," `AgentHostStateManager` owns the session summary's aggregate status. Any chat needing input takes priority, followed by any chat in progress. Otherwise the default chat's status applies, or the most recently modified chat's when no default exists. Errors remain on individual chats and are not promoted from peers. The session retains its own read/archive flags, and aggregate activity follows the chat driving the status."," ","+`AgentHostKeepAwake` owns idle-sleep inhibition for the machine running the host, including standalone/remote hosts and work without a connected window. It uses `hasRunningChats`, not aggregate session status or `hasActiveSessions`: a live turn blocked on input must not hold the machine awake, while a running peer still must. The hold releases two minutes after the last running chat stops; changing the keep-awake mode releases it immediately. The host persists the mode mirrored from `sessions.keepAwakeWhileWorking`: `never`, `always` (default), or `whenPluggedIn`. The last mode requires confirmed external power on the host, not the connecting client. Desktop utility-process hosts request Electron's blocker through the main process; on Linux desktop, Electron cannot determine the power source, so `whenPluggedIn` does not acquire a blocker. Standalone Node hosts use OS helpers (`caffeinate`, systemd/logind idle inhibition, or a Windows native execution-state request). Helpers release on host exit, and unavailable facilities/permissions are logged and retried without failing agent work.","+"," ### Terminology convention: \"session\" is overloaded — read it by layer"," "," The word **session** means two different things depending on which side of the seam you are on. To avoid confusion, follow this convention:"],"additions":2,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/vs/platform/agentHost/common/agentHostPowerSaveBlocker.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,34 @@","+/*---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------","+ *  Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation. All rights reserved.","+ *  Licensed under the MIT License. See License.txt in the project root for license information.","+ *--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/","+","+export const AgentHostPowerSaveBlockerMessageType = 'vscode:agentHostPowerSaveBlocker';","+","+export type AgentHostPowerSaveBlockerMessage =","+\t| { readonly type: typeof AgentHostPowerSaveBlockerMessageType; readonly kind: 'acquire'; readonly allowOnBattery: boolean }","+\t| { readonly type: typeof AgentHostPowerSaveBlockerMessageType; readonly kind: 'release' };","+","+export type AgentHostPowerSaveBlockerRequest = { readonly kind: 'acquire'; readonly allowOnBattery: boolean } | { readonly kind: 'release' };","+","+export function toAgentHostPowerSaveBlockerMessage(request: AgentHostPowerSaveBlockerRequest): AgentHostPowerSaveBlockerMessage {","+\treturn { type: AgentHostPowerSaveBlockerMessageType, ...request };","+}","+","+export function parseAgentHostPowerSaveBlockerMessage(message: unknown): AgentHostPowerSaveBlockerRequest | undefined {","+\tif (!message || typeof message !== 'object') {","+\t\treturn undefined;","+\t}","+","+\tconst candidate = message as { type?: unknown; kind?: unknown; allowOnBattery?: unknown };","+\tif (candidate.type !== AgentHostPowerSaveBlockerMessageType) {","+\t\treturn undefined;","+\t}","+\tif (candidate.kind === 'release') {","+\t\treturn { kind: 'release' };","+\t}","+\tif (candidate.kind === 'acquire' && typeof candidate.allowOnBattery === 'boolean') {","+\t\treturn { kind: 'acquire', allowOnBattery: candidate.allowOnBattery };","+\t}","+\treturn undefined;","+}"],"additions":34,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/vs/platform/agentHost/common/agentHostSchema.ts","lines":["@@ -731,6 +731,24 @@ export const AgentHostOverlapProviderPreparationConfigKey = 'overlapProviderPrep","  * Copilot draft starts its SDK session and MCP servers before the first send.","  */"," export const AgentHostPrewarmSessionsConfigKey = 'prewarmSessions';","+export const AgentHostKeepAwakeConfigKey = 'keepAwakeWhileWorking';","+","+export const enum AgentHostKeepAwakeMode {","+\tNever = 'never',","+\tAlways = 'always',","+\tWhenPluggedIn = 'whenPluggedIn',","+}","+","+export const agentHostKeepAwakeConfiguration = {","+\ttype: 'string' as const,","+\tenum: [AgentHostKeepAwakeMode.Never, AgentHostKeepAwakeMode.Always, AgentHostKeepAwakeMode.WhenPluggedIn],","+\tenumDescriptions: [","+\t\tlocalize('agentHost.config.keepAwake.never', \"Allow idle sleep while a chat is working.\"),","+\t\tlocalize('agentHost.config.keepAwake.always', \"Prevent idle sleep while a chat is working, even on battery power.\"),","+\t\tlocalize('agentHost.config.keepAwake.whenPluggedIn', \"Prevent idle sleep only while the host is plugged in. On Linux desktop, the power source is unavailable, so this option allows idle sleep.\"),","+\t],","+\tdefault: AgentHostKeepAwakeMode.Always,","+};"," "," export const AgentHostShowExternalSessionsConfigKey = 'showExternalSessions';"," ","@@ -1158,6 +1176,11 @@ export const platformRootSchema = createSchema({"," \t\tdescription: localize('agentHost.config.prewarmSessions.description', \"Whether new Copilot chats start their runtime and MCP servers before the first message.\"),"," \t\tdefault: true,"," \t}),","+\t[AgentHostKeepAwakeConfigKey]: schemaProperty<AgentHostKeepAwakeMode>({","+\t\t...agentHostKeepAwakeConfiguration,","+\t\ttitle: localize('agentHost.config.keepAwake.title', \"Keep Awake While Working\"),","+\t\tdescription: localize('agentHost.config.keepAwake.description', \"Controls when this Agent Host prevents idle sleep while a chat is working. The display can turn off and explicit sleep is not inhibited.\"),","+\t}),"," \t[AgentHostShowExternalSessionsConfigKey]: schemaProperty<ChatExternalSessionsMode>({"," \t\ttype: 'string',"," \t\ttitle: localize('agentHost.config.showExternalSessions.title', \"Show External Agent Sessions\"),"],"additions":23,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/vs/platform/agentHost/common/agentHostStarter.config.contribution.ts","lines":["@@ -60,6 +60,8 @@ import {"," \tAgentHostMarkdownPlanRichLinksEnabledConfigKey,"," \tAgentHostOverlapProviderPreparationConfigKey,"," \tAgentHostPrewarmSessionsConfigKey,","+\tAgentHostKeepAwakeConfigKey,","+\tagentHostKeepAwakeConfiguration,"," \tAgentHostSystemProxyEnabledConfigKey,"," \tAgentHostWorkspaceSnapshotEnabledConfigKey,"," \tAgentHostMcpSkillsEnabledConfigKey,","@@ -237,6 +239,13 @@ configurationRegistry.registerConfiguration({"," \t\t},"," \t\t...chatMoveConfigurationProperties,"," \t\t...titleGenerationConfigurationProperties,","+\t\t'sessions.keepAwakeWhileWorking': {","+\t\t\t...agentHostKeepAwakeConfiguration,","+\t\t\ttags: ['preview'],","+\t\t\tscope: ConfigurationScope.MACHINE,","+\t\t\tdescription: nls.localize('sessions.keepAwakeWhileWorking', \"Controls when each connected Agent Host keeps its machine from idle-sleeping while a chat is working, where supported. The hold is released shortly after work ends and does not require an open window. The display can turn off and explicit sleep is not inhibited.\"),","+\t\t\tagentHost: { key: AgentHostKeepAwakeConfigKey },","+\t\t},"," \t\t...artifactToolsConfigurationProperties,"," \t\t[CanvasesEnabledSettingId]: {"," \t\t\ttype: 'boolean',"],"additions":9,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/vs/platform/agentHost/electron-main/agentHostPowerSaveBlocker.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,80 @@","+/*---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------","+ *  Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation. All rights reserved.","+ *  Licensed under the MIT License. See License.txt in the project root for license information.","+ *--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/","+","+import { RunOnceScheduler } from '../../../base/common/async.js';","+import { Event } from '../../../base/common/event.js';","+import { Disposable, IDisposable, MutableDisposable } from '../../../base/common/lifecycle.js';","+import { isMacintosh, isWindows } from '../../../base/common/platform.js';","+import { createPowerSaveBlocker, isOnBatteryPower, onDidChangeOnBatteryPower } from '../../native/electron-main/power.js';","+import { ILogService } from '../../log/common/log.js';","+import { parseAgentHostPowerSaveBlockerMessage } from '../common/agentHostPowerSaveBlocker.js';","+","+interface IAgentHostPowerRuntime {","+\treadonly supportsBatteryPower: boolean;","+\treadonly onDidChangeOnBatteryPower: Event<boolean>;","+\tisOnBatteryPower(): boolean;","+\tcreatePowerSaveBlocker(): IDisposable;","+}","+","+const electronPowerRuntime: IAgentHostPowerRuntime = {","+\tsupportsBatteryPower: isMacintosh || isWindows,","+\tonDidChangeOnBatteryPower,","+\tisOnBatteryPower,","+\tcreatePowerSaveBlocker: () => createPowerSaveBlocker('prevent-app-suspension'),","+};","+","+export class AgentHostElectronPowerSaveBlocker extends Disposable {","+\tprivate readonly _blocker = this._register(new MutableDisposable<IDisposable>());","+\tprivate readonly _poll = this._register(new RunOnceScheduler(() => this._update(), 30_000));","+\tprivate _allowOnBattery: boolean | undefined;","+","+\tconstructor(","+\t\tprivate readonly _logService: ILogService,","+\t\tprivate readonly _powerRuntime: IAgentHostPowerRuntime = electronPowerRuntime,","+\t) {","+\t\tsuper();","+\t\tif (_powerRuntime.supportsBatteryPower) {","+\t\t\tthis._register(_powerRuntime.onDidChangeOnBatteryPower(() => this._update()));","+\t\t}","+\t}","+","+\thandleMessage(message: unknown): void {","+\t\tconst request = parseAgentHostPowerSaveBlockerMessage(message);","+\t\tif (!request) {","+\t\t\treturn;","+\t\t}","+","+\t\tif (request.kind === 'release' || (!request.allowOnBattery && !this._powerRuntime.supportsBatteryPower)) {","+\t\t\tthis._allowOnBattery = undefined;","+\t\t\tthis._poll.cancel();","+\t\t\tthis._blocker.clear();","+\t\t\treturn;","+\t\t}","+","+\t\tthis._allowOnBattery = request.allowOnBattery;","+\t\tthis._update();","+\t}","+","+\tprivate _update(): void {","+\t\tif (this._allowOnBattery === undefined) {","+\t\t\treturn;","+\t\t}","+","+\t\ttry {","+\t\t\tif (this._allowOnBattery || !this._powerRuntime.isOnBatteryPower()) {","+\t\t\t\tthis._blocker.value ??= this._powerRuntime.createPowerSaveBlocker();","+\t\t\t} else {","+\t\t\t\tthis._blocker.clear();","+\t\t\t}","+\t\t} catch (error) {","+\t\t\tthis._blocker.clear();","+\t\t\tthis._logService.warn('[AgentHostKeepAwake] Cannot inhibit idle sleep on this host', error);","+\t\t}","+","+\t\tif (this._allowOnBattery !== undefined) {","+\t\t\tthis._poll.schedule();","+\t\t}","+\t}","+}"],"additions":80,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/vs/platform/agentHost/electron-main/electronAgentHostStarter.ts","lines":["@@ -35,6 +35,7 @@ import { deepClone } from '../../../base/common/objects.js';"," import '../common/agentHostStarter.config.contribution.js';"," import { AgentHostAhpJsonlLoggingEnvVar } from '../common/ahpJsonlLogger.js';"," import { AgentHostWakeNetworkMonitor } from '../common/agentHostWakeNetworkMonitor.js';","+import { AgentHostElectronPowerSaveBlocker } from './agentHostPowerSaveBlocker.js';"," "," /** The distributed notification macOS posts when it changes which apps it trusts for Accessibility. */"," const MacAccessibilityTrustChangedNotification = 'com.apple.accessibility.api';","@@ -215,6 +216,10 @@ export class ElectronAgentHostStarter extends Disposable implements IAgentHostSt"," \t\t\tsampleMemory: pid => this._sampleProcessMemory(pid),"," \t\t\tgetExitContext: exitTime => this._getExitContext(exitTime),"," \t\t});","+\t\tconst store = new DisposableStore();","+\t\tstore.add(exitDiagnostics);","+\t\tconst powerSaveBlocker = store.add(new AgentHostElectronPowerSaveBlocker(this._logService));","+\t\tstore.add(utilityProcess.onMessage(message => powerSaveBlocker.handleMessage(message)));"," "," \t\ttry {"," \t\t\tif (!utilityProcess.start({","@@ -247,8 +252,6 @@ export class ElectronAgentHostStarter extends Disposable implements IAgentHostSt"," \t\t\tconst client = new MessagePortClient(port, AgentHostMainProcessConnectionContext);"," \t\t\tconst managementService = ProxyChannel.toService<IAgentHostManagementService>(client.getChannel(AgentHostIpcChannels.Management));"," ","-\t\t\tconst store = new DisposableStore();","-\t\t\tstore.add(exitDiagnostics);"," \t\t\tthis._managementService = managementService;"," \t\t\tstore.add(toDisposable(() => {"," \t\t\t\tif (this._managementService === managementService) {","@@ -294,7 +297,7 @@ export class ElectronAgentHostStarter extends Disposable implements IAgentHostSt"," \t\t\t\tshutdown: () => managementService.shutdown(),"," \t\t\t};"," \t\t} catch (error) {","-\t\t\texitDiagnostics.dispose();","+\t\t\tstore.dispose();"," \t\t\tthis._disposeUtilityProcess(utilityProcess);"," \t\t\tif (isFatalAgentHostStartError(error)) {"," \t\t\t\tthrow toFatalAgentHostStartError(error);"],"additions":6,"deletions":3,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/vs/platform/agentHost/node/agentHostKeepAwake.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,56 @@","+/*---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------","+ *  Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation. All rights reserved.","+ *  Licensed under the MIT License. See License.txt in the project root for license information.","+ *--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/","+","+import { RunOnceScheduler } from '../../../base/common/async.js';","+import { Disposable, IDisposable, MutableDisposable } from '../../../base/common/lifecycle.js';","+import { agentHostKeepAwakeConfiguration, AgentHostKeepAwakeConfigKey, AgentHostKeepAwakeMode, platformRootSchema } from '../common/agentHostSchema.js';","+import { ActionType } from '../common/state/sessionActions.js';","+import { IAgentConfigurationService } from './agentConfigurationService.js';","+import { AgentHostStateManager, IAgentHostStateManager } from './agentHostStateManager.js';","+","+/**","+ * Owns this host's idle-sleep inhibition, independently of any connected window.","+ * The backend owns OS facilities and any asynchronous acquisition/cleanup.","+ */","+export class AgentHostKeepAwake extends Disposable {","+\tstatic readonly RELEASE_DELAY = 2 * 60 * 1000;","+","+\tprivate readonly _hold = this._register(new MutableDisposable<IDisposable>());","+\tprivate readonly _release = this._register(new RunOnceScheduler(() => this._hold.clear(), AgentHostKeepAwake.RELEASE_DELAY));","+\tprivate _mode: AgentHostKeepAwakeMode | undefined;","+","+\tconstructor(","+\t\tprivate readonly _acquire: (allowOnBattery: boolean) => IDisposable,","+\t\t@IAgentHostStateManager private readonly _stateManager: AgentHostStateManager,","+\t\t@IAgentConfigurationService private readonly _configurationService: IAgentConfigurationService,","+\t) {","+\t\tsuper();","+\t\tthis._register(_configurationService.onDidRootConfigChange(() => this._update()));","+\t\tthis._register(_stateManager.onDidChangeSessionActiveTurn(() => this._update()));","+\t\tthis._register(_stateManager.onDidRemoveSession(() => this._update()));","+\t\tthis._register(_stateManager.onDidEmitEnvelope(({ action }) => {","+\t\t\t// Aggregate session status can hide running peers behind a chat needing input.","+\t\t\tif (action.type === ActionType.SessionChatUpdated || action.type === ActionType.SessionChatRemoved) {","+\t\t\t\tthis._update();","+\t\t\t}","+\t\t}));","+\t\tthis._update();","+\t}","+","+\tprivate _update(): void {","+\t\tconst mode = this._configurationService.getRootValue(platformRootSchema, AgentHostKeepAwakeConfigKey) ?? agentHostKeepAwakeConfiguration.default;","+\t\tif (mode !== this._mode) {","+\t\t\tthis._release.cancel();","+\t\t\tthis._hold.clear();","+\t\t\tthis._mode = mode;","+\t\t}","+\t\tif (mode !== AgentHostKeepAwakeMode.Never && this._stateManager.hasRunningChats) {","+\t\t\tthis._release.cancel();","+\t\t\tthis._hold.value ??= this._acquire(mode === AgentHostKeepAwakeMode.Always);","+\t\t} else if (this._hold.value && !this._release.isScheduled()) {","+\t\t\tthis._release.schedule();","+\t\t}","+\t}","+}"],"additions":56,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/vs/platform/agentHost/node/agentHostMain.ts","lines":["@@ -58,6 +58,9 @@ import { localize } from '../../../nls.js';"," import { IFileService } from '../../files/common/files.js';"," import { IInstantiationService } from '../../instantiation/common/instantiation.js';"," import { createAgentHostRuntime, type IAgentHostRuntime } from './agentHostBootstrap.js';","+import { AgentHostKeepAwake } from './agentHostKeepAwake.js';","+import { AgentHostPowerSaveBlocker } from './agentHostPowerSaveBlocker.js';","+import { toAgentHostPowerSaveBlockerMessage } from '../common/agentHostPowerSaveBlocker.js';"," import { BANG_COMMAND_PREFIX } from './agentHostBangCommand.js';"," import { AgentHostClientFileSystemProvider } from '../common/agentHostClientFileSystemProvider.js';"," import { AGENT_CLIENT_SCHEME } from '../common/agentClientUri.js';","@@ -195,6 +198,13 @@ async function startAgentHost(): Promise<void> {"," \t\tdisposables.add(runtime);"," \t\tagentService = runtime.agentService;"," \t\tinstantiationService = runtime.instantiationService;","+\t\tconst acquirePowerSaveBlocker = diagnosticsParentPort","+\t\t\t? (allowOnBattery: boolean) => {","+\t\t\t\tdiagnosticsParentPort.postMessage(toAgentHostPowerSaveBlockerMessage({ kind: 'acquire', allowOnBattery }));","+\t\t\t\treturn toDisposable(() => diagnosticsParentPort.postMessage(toAgentHostPowerSaveBlockerMessage({ kind: 'release' })));","+\t\t\t}","+\t\t\t: (allowOnBattery: boolean) => new AgentHostPowerSaveBlocker(allowOnBattery, logService);","+\t\tdisposables.add(instantiationService.createInstance(AgentHostKeepAwake, acquirePowerSaveBlocker));"," \t\tconst runtimeServices = instantiationService.invokeFunction(accessor => ({"," \t\t\tconfigurationService: accessor.get(IAgentConfigurationService),"," \t\t\tfileService: accessor.get(IFileService),"],"additions":10,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/vs/platform/agentHost/node/agentHostPowerSaveBlocker.ts","lines":["@@ -0,0 +1,264 @@","+/*---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------","+ *  Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation. All rights reserved.","+ *  Licensed under the MIT License. See License.txt in the project root for license information.","+ *--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------*/","+","+import { execFile, spawn, type ChildProcess } from 'child_process';","+import { readFile, readdir } from 'fs/promises';","+import { promisify } from 'util';","+import { RunOnceScheduler } from '../../../base/common/async.js';","+import { Disposable, IDisposable, MutableDisposable, toDisposable } from '../../../base/common/lifecycle.js';","+import { join } from '../../../base/common/path.js';","+import { isLinux, isMacintosh, isWindows } from '../../../base/common/platform.js';","+import { ILogService } from '../../log/common/log.js';","+","+const execFileAsync = promisify(execFile);","+","+interface IAgentHostPowerBackend {","+\tstart(allowOnBattery: boolean): ChildProcess;","+\tisOnBatteryPower(): Promise<boolean>;","+\treadonly killOnDispose: boolean;","+}","+","+interface ILinuxPowerSupply {","+\treadonly type: string;","+\treadonly scope?: string;","+\treadonly online?: string;","+\treadonly status?: string;","+}","+","+const linePowerSupplyTypes = new Set(['Mains', 'USB', 'USB_C', 'USB_PD', 'USB_PD_DRP', 'Wireless', 'UPS']);","+","+const nativePowerBackend: IAgentHostPowerBackend = {","+\tstart: startNativePowerSaveBlocker,","+\tisOnBatteryPower: async () => !isWindows && isOnBatteryPower(),","+\tkillOnDispose: isMacintosh,","+};","+","+/**","+ * A process-lifetime power request. Helpers also release on parent death:","+ * caffeinate watches our PID; the Linux and Windows helpers watch stdin EOF.","+ */","+export class AgentHostPowerSaveBlocker extends Disposable {","+\tprivate readonly _process = this._register(new MutableDisposable<IDisposable>());","+\tprivate readonly _poll = this._register(new RunOnceScheduler(() => void this._update(), 30_000));","+","+\tconstructor(","+\t\tprivate readonly _allowOnBattery: boolean,","+\t\tprivate readonly _logService: ILogService,","+\t\tprivate readonly _backend: IAgentHostPowerBackend = nativePowerBackend,","+\t) {","+\t\tsuper();","+\t\tvoid this._update();","+\t}","+","+\tprivate async _update(): Promise<void> {","+\t\ttry {","+\t\t\t// The Windows helper monitors its own power source, avoiding repeated PowerShell startups.","+\t\t\tconst allowed = this._allowOnBattery || !await this._backend.isOnBatteryPower();","+\t\t\tif (this._store.isDisposed) {","+\t\t\t\treturn;","+\t\t\t}","+\t\t\tif (!allowed) {","+\t\t\t\tthis._process.clear();","+\t\t\t} else if (!this._process.value) {","+\t\t\t\tthis._process.value = this._start();","+\t\t\t}","+\t\t} catch (error) {","+\t\t\tif (!this._store.isDisposed) {","+\t\t\t\tthis._process.clear();","+\t\t\t\tthis._logService.warn('[AgentHostKeepAwake] Cannot inhibit idle sleep on this host', error);","+\t\t\t}","+\t\t}","+\t\tif (!this._store.isDisposed) {","+\t\t\tthis._poll.schedule();","+\t\t}","+\t}","+","+\tprivate _start(): IDisposable {","+\t\tconst child = this._backend.start(this._allowOnBattery);","+\t\tlet disposed = false;","+\t\tlet stderr = '';","+\t\tchild.stdout?.once('data', () => this._logService.trace('[AgentHostKeepAwake] Idle sleep inhibitor helper is ready'));","+\t\tchild.stderr?.on('data', (data: Buffer) => stderr = (stderr + data.toString()).slice(-4096));","+\t\tchild.on('error', error => {","+\t\t\tif (!disposed) {","+\t\t\t\tthis._logService.warn('[AgentHostKeepAwake] Failed to start idle sleep inhibitor', error);","+\t\t\t}","+\t\t});","+\t\tchild.on('close', (code, signal) => {","+\t\t\tif (!disposed) {","+\t\t\t\tthis._logService.warn(`[AgentHostKeepAwake] Idle sleep inhibitor exited (${code ?? signal}): ${stderr}`);","+\t\t\t\tthis._process.clear();","+\t\t\t}","+\t\t});","+\t\tchild.stdin?.on('error', error => {","+\t\t\tif (!disposed) {","+\t\t\t\tthis._logService.warn('[AgentHostKeepAwake] Idle sleep inhibitor input failed', error);","+\t\t\t\tthis._process.clear();","+\t\t\t}","+\t\t});","+\t\treturn toDisposable(() => {","+\t\t\tdisposed = true;","+\t\t\tchild.stdin?.end();","+\t\t\t// caffeinate ignores stdin. For the other helpers EOF releases native","+\t\t\t// resources and exits, including when this process is killed abruptly.","+\t\t\tif (this._backend.killOnDispose) {","+\t\t\t\tchild.kill();","+\t\t\t}","+\t\t});","+\t}","+}","+","+export function startNativePowerSaveBlocker(allowOnBattery: boolean): ChildProcess {","+\tif (isMacintosh) {","+\t\treturn spawn('/usr/bin/caffeinate', ['-i', '-w', String(process.pid)], { stdio: ['pipe', 'ignore', 'pipe'] });","+\t}","+\tif (isLinux) {","+\t\t// Piped stdin prevents polkit prompts; EOF releases the inhibitor.","+\t\treturn spawn('systemd-inhibit', ['--what=idle', '--mode=block', '--who=VS Code Agent Host', '--why=An agent is working', 'cat'], { stdio: ['pipe', 'ignore', 'pipe'] });","+\t}","+\tif (isWindows) {","+\t\tconst systemRoot = process.env['SystemRoot'];","+\t\tif (!systemRoot) {","+\t\t\tthrow new Error('SystemRoot is not set');","+\t\t}","+\t\treturn spawn(join(systemRoot, 'System32', 'WindowsPowerShell', 'v1.0', 'powershell.exe'), [","+\t\t\t'-NoLogo', '-NoProfile', '-NonInteractive', '-Command',","+\t\t\t`${windowsPowerSaveBlockerScript}\\n[AgentHostPowerSaveBlocker]::Run($${allowOnBattery})`,","+\t\t], { windowsHide: true, stdio: ['pipe', 'pipe', 'pipe'] });","+\t}","+\tthrow new Error('Idle sleep inhibition is not supported on this platform');","+}","+","+async function isOnBatteryPower(): Promise<boolean> {","+\tif (isMacintosh) {","+\t\tconst { stdout } = await execFileAsync('/usr/bin/pmset', ['-g', 'batt'], { timeout: 5000 });","+\t\tif (stdout.includes('\\'Battery Power\\'')) {","+\t\t\treturn true;","+\t\t}","+\t\tif (stdout.includes('\\'AC Power\\'')) {","+\t\t\treturn false;","+\t\t}","+\t\tthrow new Error('pmset did not report a power source');","+\t}","+\tif (isLinux) {","+\t\tconst supplies = '/sys/class/power_supply';","+\t\tconst powerSupplies: ILinuxPowerSupply[] = [];","+\t\tfor (const entry of await readdir(supplies)) {","+\t\t\tconst path = join(supplies, entry);","+\t\t\tconst type = await readOptionalFile(join(path, 'type'));","+\t\t\tif (!type) {","+\t\t\t\tcontinue;","+\t\t\t}","+\t\t\tconst scope = await readOptionalFile(join(path, 'scope'));","+\t\t\tif (scope === 'Device') {","+\t\t\t\tcontinue;","+\t\t\t}","+\t\t\tif (linePowerSupplyTypes.has(type)) {","+\t\t\t\tpowerSupplies.push({ type, scope, online: await readOptionalFile(join(path, 'online')) });","+\t\t\t} else if (type === 'Battery') {","+\t\t\t\tpowerSupplies.push({ type, scope, status: await readOptionalFile(join(path, 'status')) });","+\t\t\t}","+\t\t}","+\t\treturn isOnBatteryPowerFromLinuxSupplies(powerSupplies);","+\t}","+\tthrow new Error('Power source detection is not supported on this platform');","+}","+","+async function readOptionalFile(path: string): Promise<string | undefined> {","+\ttry {","+\t\treturn (await readFile(path, 'utf8')).trim();","+\t} catch (error) {","+\t\tif ((error as NodeJS.ErrnoException).code === 'ENOENT') {","+\t\t\treturn undefined;","+\t\t}","+\t\tthrow error;","+\t}","+}","+","+/**","+ * Determines whether the host is on battery using Linux power-supply readings.","+ */","+export function isOnBatteryPowerFromLinuxSupplies(supplies: readonly ILinuxPowerSupply[]): boolean {","+\tlet hasOfflineLinePower = false;","+\tlet hasDischargingBattery = false;","+\tfor (const supply of supplies) {","+\t\tif (supply.scope === 'Device') {","+\t\t\tcontinue;","+\t\t}","+\t\tif (linePowerSupplyTypes.has(supply.type)) {","+\t\t\tif (supply.online === '1') {","+\t\t\t\treturn false;","+\t\t\t}","+\t\t\tif (supply.online === '0') {","+\t\t\t\thasOfflineLinePower = true;","+\t\t\t}","+\t\t} else if (supply.type === 'Battery' && supply.status === 'Discharging') {","+\t\t\thasDischargingBattery = true;","+\t\t}","+\t}","+\tif (hasOfflineLinePower || hasDischargingBattery) {","+\t\treturn true;","+\t}","+\tthrow new Error('Power source is unknown');","+}","+","+// Keep the native call on one thread. ES_SYSTEM_REQUIRED inhibits idle system","+// sleep without keeping the display on or overriding an explicit sleep request.","+const windowsPowerSaveBlockerScript = `","+$ErrorActionPreference = 'Stop'","+Add-Type -TypeDefinition @'","+using System;","+using System.ComponentModel;","+using System.Runtime.InteropServices;","+public static class AgentHostPowerSaveBlocker {","+\t[DllImport(\"kernel32.dll\", SetLastError = true)]","+\tstatic extern uint SetThreadExecutionState(uint flags);","+\t[DllImport(\"kernel32.dll\", SetLastError = true)]","+\tstatic extern bool GetSystemPowerStatus(out PowerStatus status);","+\t[StructLayout(LayoutKind.Sequential)]","+\tstruct PowerStatus {","+\t\tpublic byte ACLineStatus, BatteryFlag, BatteryLifePercent, SystemStatusFlag;","+\t\tpublic uint BatteryLifeTime, BatteryFullLifeTime;","+\t}","+\tpublic static void Run(bool allowOnBattery) {","+\t\tconst uint continuous = 0x80000000;","+\t\tbool holding = false;","+\t\tbool ready = false;","+\t\t// Console.In can implement ReadLineAsync synchronously on Windows PowerShell.","+\t\tvar input = System.Threading.Tasks.Task.Run(() => Console.OpenStandardInput().ReadByte());","+\t\ttry {","+\t\t\tdo {","+\t\t\t\tbool allowed = allowOnBattery;","+\t\t\t\tif (!allowOnBattery) {","+\t\t\t\t\tPowerStatus status;","+\t\t\t\t\tif (!GetSystemPowerStatus(out status)) {","+\t\t\t\t\t\tthrow new Win32Exception(Marshal.GetLastWin32Error());","+\t\t\t\t\t}","+\t\t\t\t\tbool noBattery = status.BatteryFlag != 255 && (status.BatteryFlag & 128) != 0;","+\t\t\t\t\tif (status.ACLineStatus == 255 && !noBattery) {","+\t\t\t\t\t\tthrow new InvalidOperationException(\"Unknown power source\");","+\t\t\t\t\t}","+\t\t\t\t\tallowed = status.ACLineStatus == 1 || noBattery;","+\t\t\t\t}","+\t\t\t\tif (allowed != holding) {","+\t\t\t\t\tif (SetThreadExecutionState(continuous | (allowed ? 1u : 0u)) == 0) {","+\t\t\t\t\t\tthrow new Win32Exception(Marshal.GetLastWin32Error());","+\t\t\t\t\t}","+\t\t\t\t\tholding = allowed;","+\t\t\t\t}","+\t\t\t\tif (!ready) {","+\t\t\t\t\tConsole.WriteLine(\"ready\");","+\t\t\t\t\tready = true;","+\t\t\t\t}","+\t\t\t} while (!input.Wait(15000));","+\t\t} finally {","+\t\t\tif (holding && SetThreadExecutionState(continuous) == 0) {","+\t\t\t\tthrow new Win32Exception(Marshal.GetLastWin32Error());","+\t\t\t}","+\t\t}","+\t}","+}","+'@","+`;"],"additions":264,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"src/vs/platform/agentHost/node/agentHostServerMain.ts","lines":["@@ -33,6 +33,8 @@ import { parseShutdownTimeoutArg, shutdownAgentHostBeforeDispose } from './agent"," import { flushAgentHostTelemetry } from './agentHostTelemetryService.js';"," import { ITelemetryService } from '../../telemetry/common/telemetry.js';"," import { createAgentHostRuntime } from './agentHostBootstrap.js';","+import { AgentHostKeepAwake } from './agentHostKeepAwake.js';","+import { AgentHostPowerSaveBlocker } from './agentHostPowerSaveBlocker.js';"," import { IAgentConfigurationService } from './agentConfigurationService.js';"," import { IAgentHostCompletions } from './agentHostCompletions.js';"," import { IAgentHostCustomizationEnablementService } from './agentHostCustomizationEnablementService.js';","@@ -218,6 +220,7 @@ asyn